# Introductory Page Version Date

With each update to this project—regardless of what changed—always update the date on the introductory page to the current date.

## Location

The date lives in `src/FernIdentifier.tsx` in the `INTRO_LINES` constant, on the line that starts with `'Version 0.1  '`.

## Format

Use the format `DDMonYY` (e.g., `27Feb26`, `15Mar26`).

## Example

When making any edit (UI change, bug fix, new feature, etc.), update that line:

```
'Version 0.1  [today's date in DDMonYY format]',
```
